SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

The MIT grant above covers the code, documentation and measurement records in
this repository. It does not and cannot cover model weights.

No model weight file is contained in this repository. The renderer downloads five
files at container build time from their own sources, each under its own licence,
and those licences are not MIT. One of them -- the ClassipeintXL v2.1 style LoRA
by eldritchadam -- permits private, free, single-user use and prohibits
redistribution and any service that monetizes image generation.

Before building, publishing or redeploying anything from this repository, read
flash-imagegen/MODELS.md, which lists every file, its source, its licence, and
the four conditions this project operates under.

Copyright holder: Twelve Rocks LLC (Kris Bennett).
